<title>FRANCE: UBS recommendation boosts Danone.</title>
<headline>UBS recommendation boosts Danone.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in food group Danone were up 3.5 percent on the Paris bourse after brokerage Union Bank of Switzerland (UBS) raised its recommendation on the stock to buy from hold.</p>
<p>Danone shares were 25 francs higher at 742 at 1210 GMT. The CAC index was up 1.1 percent at the same time.</p>
<p>UBS raised its rating on the grounds that Danone was undervalued by 20 percent in comparison with foreign competitors, such as Unilever, and in relation to the Paris bourse's gains.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
